one player must say goodbye.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6CWPPXOo74btRBjvKBFytuc6BNB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-08\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Picking Teams\",\"overview\":\"Two new players settle into the Circle, just in time for trivia night. On the heels of a competitive match, Sammie makes an emotional reveal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8zK9tICLsXpeVO4epGjmO6AySOr.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-08\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Player I'm Saving Is ...\",\"overview\":\"Tension and tenderness intersect as the influencers deal with an elimination twist, and two players connect in person. A new face joins the fun.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xWQiD09wLa4bkfiJNzLFCs85uvm.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-08\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Instant Block\",\"overview\":\"How about another round of shake-ups? Sean shares a personal secret with the Circle, and a face-to-face meeting makes for an unusual bond.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kD8yoRtWo0U0RGlGJ1aNSZ6sBKI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-15\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Declare Your Rival\",\"overview\":\"The Circle dials up the drama with a cutthroat round of true confessions. The game’s first “superinfluencer” steps into power.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zkL6xGbyZ8au5plmWFoniptZrKr.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-15\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Last Rating\",\"overview\":\"As the experiment winds down, Sammie and Ed bond over similar suspicions. The players prepare to choose a winner -- and orchestrate one last block.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hsEy4CCHyWhYt1YT9M29f1Vf0DC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-15\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Finale\",\"overvie